# generalization): the abstract effective Boolean algebra (EBA) and the closure
# family (product/sum/collection/tree), plus the Heyting tier and tier/behavioral
# negation proofs.
#
# Dependency order (each file is self-contained unless noted):
#   EffectiveBooleanAlgebra.v   — EBA record + laws + derived Boolean identities

