# OSLF substrate Phase 1 `.0`-inert: AnyAlgebra carrier projection soundness
# (fold_pred ⊥-projection + scalar-wrapper faithfulness). Depends on
# EffectiveBooleanAlgebra + Product/Sum closure (for the combinator-layer
# re-export).
theories/AnyAlgebraProjectionSound.v
# OSLF substrate Phase 1 `.1`: guard-tier classifier soundness
# (classify_decidability_sorted) + structural∪behavioral partition-fold
# soundness. Depends on GuardTierCertificate (Tier lattice + guarantee
# homomorphisms) and AnyAlgebraProjectionSound (registry decision = leaf EBA
# decision via wrapper_sat_faithful).
theories/GuardTierClassificationSound.v
# OSLF substrate Phase 2 `.1`: structural-type recognizer wiring soundness
# (sym_tree decision soundness: sat↔¬empty / disjoint=conj-empty /
# subtype=conj-neg-empty; finite-alphabet agreement over the trivial single-class
# payload partition; payload-guard faithfulness at the Tree combinator layer).
# Depends on TreeAlgebraClosure (tree EBA + tsat/tconj/tneg laws),
# EffectiveBooleanAlgebra (sat_false_iff_empty + decides_implies), and
# AnyAlgebraProjectionSound (wrapper_sat_faithful at A := tree_eba).
theories/SymTreeWiringSound.v
# OSLF substrate Phase 3 `.1`: behavioral decidability-classifier wiring soundness
# (BehavioralFormula::decidability_tier). The classifier routes a guard to the
# exact relational runtime (tier ≤ T2) IFF the guard is non-modal (has an exact
# decision procedure), so a semi-decidable modal guard is never mis-routed to the
# relational-only evaluator. Self-contained (models the modal-vs-relational shape
# only).
theories/BehavioralTierClassificationSound.v
# OSLF substrate Phase 8: Z3/SMT witness-check soundness. A certificate-checked
# witness (re-validated under the pure evaluator) implies satisfiable, by
# construction — so the Z3 oracle's trusted Sat is certificate-backed and NO new
# admission enters the proven EBA core. Self-contained.
theories/Z3WitnessChecked.v
# OSLF substrate Phase 9: behavioral_pred -> behavioral_algebra relational-core
# lowering soundness. The lowering rejects AcMatch, never produces a modal
# operator (so a lowered carrier never mis-classifies above T2), is tier-sound,
# and pins the Implies De Morgan reduct. Reuses the BehavioralTierClassificationSound
# Tier framework; self-contained.
theories/BehavioralLoweringSound.v
